    "description": {
      "value": "<div><p class=\"Standard\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a drachensoul benefactor and at least one trait from their Energies &amp; Elements column.</p></div><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You invoke your bond with your drachensoul benefactor to reach for draconic power. </span>Until the start of your next turn, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your AC and saving throws against effects with any of your benefactor’s traits. If you possess the trait, it increases to a +2 circumstance bonus instead.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.OnjCXtm6wpHVtARY]{Effect: Drachen Link}</p>",
